    "A backup is a JSON file with your notes, schedule and finance records. Photos and the vault are not included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份是一个 JSON 文件，包含便签、日程和记账数据，不含照片和密码库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A trip groups related events. To receive reminders, add timed events to it and set their reminder times.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "行程用于归组相关日程；如需提醒，请添加有具体时间的日程并设置提前量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
